OL,3,GNEWSASadness as riverside tea rooms set
OL,4,Ato close
OL,5,
OL,6,FCustomers have expressed their
OL,7,Fdisappointment that a tea rooms
OL,8,Foverlooking a Grade II listed river
OL,9,Fgarden is due to close.
OL,11,FOperator Life Cafes said it had taken
OL,12,Fthe "difficult decision" not to
OL,13,Fcontinue its lease of the Swiss Tea
OL,14,FRooms in Belper, Derbyshire, which is
OL,15,Fowned by Amber Valley Borough Council.
OL,17,FThe council say it would "prepare the
OL,18,Fpremises for a new tenant so the Tea
OL,19,FRooms can reopen as soon as possible".
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
