OL,3,GNEWSASadness as riverside tea rooms set
OL,4,Ato close
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut for John and Jenny Richley, who
OL,7,Fhave called in for a hot drink almost
OL,8,Fevery day since it opened, the
OL,9,Fscheduled closure on 1 November is
OL,10,F"devastating."
